# Local Claude Code state (settings.local.json, caches) stays untracked, but
# .claude/skills/ is shared tooling and is committed. The pattern must ignore
# the directory's *contents* rather than the directory itself: git does not
# descend into an ignored directory, so `.claude/` would make the negation
# below unreachable.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Clangd artifacts (local index cache and build-artifact symlink)
.cache/
compile_commands.json


